{"title":"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/0073ed91e1a9a1cda445af237b7b67815147c979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JKLM$\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" /> is drawn with its vertices on the sides of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a455d533200d7dfbd00731fa8bd9e8796fb803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PQR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/f/9bf1e5a1f898db422b11eb7246758290046d9386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PJ = PK = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"116\" height=\"14\" /> m, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/8/498d2203eeef25f0a4a2a64d57e8462925343e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JQ = KR = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" /> m, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf714d449b9c6ffe450fdbb57763660b3ee8f29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KL = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> m, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1e54de87ff17f00d801c9de48ffd0dc0b15494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QR = 66$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> m, as shown\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(put graph on problem 2 page)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a\" title=\"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a\">2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2b\" title=\"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2b\">2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2c\" title=\"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2c\">2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2c</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2d\" title=\"2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2d\">2020 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2d</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1048/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.174      1 Template:Image_needed\n100.00%    6.174      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35552:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012730 and revision id 277899. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}